## 📖 Project Overview

Library of Stuff is a booking system that enables users to borrow various items including tools, appliances, and accessories. The system manages item availability, user bookings, and provides comprehensive tracking through a loyalty points system.

**Core Functionality:**
- Users can browse and book available items
- Items become unavailable when booked
- Users receive polite messages when items are unavailable
- Loyalty points reward system for frequent users
- Comprehensive search and filtering capabilities
- Real-time statistics and reporting

