## 📖 User Stories

### User Story 1: View Item Details
```
As a user
I want to view detailed information about an item
So that I can make informed borrowing decisions

Acceptance Criteria:
- Item shows ID, name, category, availability
- Hobbies, equipment, facilities displayed
- Timestamps shown
```

### User Story 2: Book Available Item
```
As a user
I want to book an available item
So that I can reserve it for my use

Acceptance Criteria:
- Item becomes unavailable after booking
- Borrower name recorded
- Confirmation message shown
- 10 loyalty points awarded
```

### User Story 3: Unavailable Item Notice
```
As a user
I want polite notification when item unavailable
So that I know who has it

Acceptance Criteria:
- Clear message shows borrower
- Suggestion to check back later
```

### User Story 4: Return Item
```
As a user
I want to return borrowed items
So that others can use them

Acceptance Criteria:
- Item becomes available
- Borrower info cleared
- Booking list updated
```

### User Story 5: Loyalty Points
```
As a frequent user
I want to earn loyalty points
So that I'm rewarded

Acceptance Criteria:
- 10 points per booking
- Tracked over time
- Leaderboard available
```

### User Story 6: View Associations
```
As a user
I want to see hobbies, equipment, facilities
So that I know requirements

Acceptance Criteria:
- All associations displayed
- Location and hours shown
```

### User Story 7: Search Items
```
As a user
I want to search items
So that I can find what I need

Acceptance Criteria:
- Search by name
- Filter by category
- Availability status shown
```

